# Answers: pick ONE of the setups below.
#
# 1) Claude (default when the key is set). Create a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
#
# 2) Claude Code CLI (uses your Claude login, no key): LLM_PROVIDER=claude-code LLM_MODEL=sonnet
#
# 3) Any OpenAI-compatible server. Examples:
#    OpenRouter free models: LLM_PROVIDER=openai LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1 LLM_API_KEY=<key> LLM_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free
#    Groq:                   LLM_PROVIDER=openai LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1 LLM_API_KEY=<key> LLM_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
#    Ollama (local, no key): LLM_PROVIDER=ollama LLM_MODEL=llama3.2
#    LM Studio (local):      LLM_PROVIDER=openai LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:1234/v1 LLM_MODEL=<loaded model>
# LLM_PROVIDER=
# LLM_BASE_URL=
# LLM_API_KEY=
# LLM_MODEL=
VITE_WHISPER_MODEL=onnx-community/whisper-base
# Override only if you self-host the bundled assets elsewhere
# VITE_VAD_ASSETS_URL=./vendor/vad/
# VITE_ORT_WASM_URL=./vendor/ort/
# VITE_TRANSFORMERS_ORT_WASM_URL=./vendor/ort-transformers/
